<title>RUSSIA: Russian T-bill trade - 1.09 trln rbls transferred.</title>
<headline>Russian T-bill trade - 1.09 trln rbls transferred.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Government securities dealers transferred 1.09 trillion roubles to their government securities trading system accounts before the market opened on Monday, the central bank's open-market operations department said.</p>
</text>
